  "summary": "GHSA-2g37-3h88-55hc: WebSocketServerExtensionHandler's per-connection queue of negotiated\nextensions grows without bound with pipelined requests. Upstream's fix\n(https://github.com/netty/netty/commit/3574f7ed7a, 4.1.138.Final) caps that queue, which was\nintroduced in 4.1.88.Final (https://github.com/netty/netty/commit/f761ab5620, #13180).\n4.1.74.Final has no queue there: the handler keeps a single List\u003cWebSocketServerExtension\u003e\nfield that each new upgrade request overwrites, so it cannot grow per request.\n",
